           TestSuite "Tests du programme Airesperi"

           TestCase "INITIALISATION remplit les dimensions"
           PERFORM INITIALISATION
           EXPECT WS-LONGUEUR TO BE 10
           EXPECT WS-LARGEUR TO BE 5

           TestCase "CALCULS : 10 x 5"
           PERFORM INITIALISATION
           PERFORM CALCULS
           EXPECT WS-SURFACE TO BE 50
           EXPECT WS-PERIMETRE TO BE 30

           TestCase "CALCULS : 0 x 5"
           MOVE 0 TO WS-LONGUEUR
           MOVE 5 TO WS-LARGEUR
           PERFORM CALCULS
           EXPECT WS-SURFACE TO BE 0
           EXPECT WS-PERIMETRE TO BE 10

           TestCase "CALCULS : 21 x 16"
           MOVE 21 TO WS-LONGUEUR
           MOVE 16 TO WS-LARGEUR
           PERFORM CALCULS
           EXPECT WS-SURFACE TO BE 336
           EXPECT WS-PERIMETRE TO BE 74
